# Cloudflare Pages redirects.
# Root → /pt-br/ (ADR 044): consolidates the Portuguese homepage. Pages applies
# _redirects before static assets, so this 301 wins even if a leftover
# index.html were present (https://developers.cloudflare.com/pages/configuration/redirects/).
# Staging (GitHub Pages) ignores this file; the staging root then 404s, which
# is acceptable because staging is noindex as a whole.
# Pilot routes (ADR 023): promoted to indexable games and must answer 301,
# since they were never indexed.
/                          /pt-br/             301
/pt-br/codigo-piloto/      /pt-br/codigo/      301
/en/code-pilot/            /en/code/           301
/pt-br/cruzadinha-piloto/  /pt-br/cruzadinha/  301
/en/crossword-pilot/       /en/crossword/      301
